Copyright 2026 claude-reflex contributors

The reflex design (rules and a small local classifier in front of the LLM, kept
in a persistent background process) is inspired by Nūs Companion
(https://github.com/potlakai/nus-companion), licensed under Apache-2.0.

The classifier uses multilingual-e5-small (intfloat, MIT license) in the ONNX
export published by Xenova on Hugging Face. The model is downloaded by
install.py and is not included in this repository.
